{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1155285-ic-hunter-the-vigil-2e-playtest-the-lucifuge-s-doubting-souls","id":1155285,"title":"[IC] (Hunter: the Vigil 2e Playtest) The Lucifuge's Doubting Souls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-02T21:40:38-07:00","id":1155285,"title":"[IC] (Hunter: the Vigil 2e Playtest) The Lucifuge's Doubting Souls","content":"<span style=\"font-size:22px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Scene 1: A Murder Most Foul</span></span></b></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Miskatonic </span></span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i>Univeristy</i></span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">, Arkham, Massachusetts </span></span></i><br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">1693 </span></span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><u><b>One Hour Ago</b></u></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Harvard may be the most prestigious university in the colonies, but Miskatonic University in Arkham is the premier destination for occult researchers. Relatively insulated from the Witch Trials of Salem to the south, this makes it the perfect cover for the Lucifuge. That doesn\u2019t mean you can throw your endowments around as you wish, though. You are the literal child of the Devil. You may not have made a pact with Satan, but that\u2019s distinction that many a witch hunter or judge would not make. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Right now you are all crammed into the office of Khalil Aziz on the wrong side of midnight. The candles are burning low, but Dean Jaeger summoned you. When the head of the Lucifuge in Arkham calls, you answer, especially since he\u2019s been hinting for a while now you are nearing the point of being ready to unlock new powers to bring Satan\u2019s wayward children to justice. Joining your cell is Brian Bartholomew. Brian is a renowned, but he\u2019s losing touch with humanity, having lost his best friend to a famine demon some months ago. Wracked by survivor\u2019s guilt, Brian\u2019s bonfire waiting to happen, but he helped you track down a legitimate witch in Boston last month, so you\u2019re happy to have him with you. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u201cChildren of Baphomet,\u201d </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">intones the Dean. </span></span><span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u201cThese are dark times. The colonies are awash in the spawn of Iblis and now blood has been shed on our very door. Murder, my sons and daughters, murder has besmirched our town, and now the library is awash in blood. Michael, your fellow constables will surely proclaim this the work of a deranged killer, but my heart tells me that the supernatural is at work! The four of you must get to the bottom of this before the killer strikes again. We will not have the flame of our Vigil turn into the wildfire that rages in Salem!\u201d </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">*************************</span></span><br /> <br /> <u><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Present</span></span></b></u><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The Dean wasn\u2019t over exaggerating. The research room where the murders took place is a bloody mess. Your lamp reveals limbs and fingers scattered about the room and bloody smear of a body crushed under a life-sized marble statue of King William III. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">As you search the room, the flickering light falls upon a sigil painted on the wall in blood. You hope it's just the shadows that are making it dance in the gloom, as looking at it makes your stomach turn over. </span></span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://img.4plebs.org/boards/tg/image/1465/44/1465442709321.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Below it, a question is written, again in blood. </span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:48px\">HAVE YE SEEN THE YELLOW SIGN?</span></span></span></span></b><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 11-03-2017, 01:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T22:58:35-07:00","id":1155304,"title":"","content":"<u>One Hour Ago</u><br /> <br /> Steph leans against a bookcase, dressed like one of King William's soldiers on leave, brow furrowed and playing with a dagger. About the only books she likes are ledgers.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anything you say,&quot; she monotones. &quot;Do we know the victim's name?&quot;<br /> <br /> Murder is a fact of life, but she's not so far gone that a killing at a university library doesn't register as wrong. Especially when the supernatural is (supposedly) involved.<br /> <br /> <u>Present</u><br /> <br /> Her lip curls as they survey the research room. &quot;Looks like a butcher shop.&quot;<br /> <br /> She looks at the sigil, but her eyes wash over it as a defense mechanism. It looks familiar. That's not a thought she wants to linger on.<br /> <br /> Being crushed by a marble statue doesn't usually cut your fingers off. She steels herself and studies the scattered body parts closely. What exactly happened to the deceased?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wits+Investigation to study the victim's body, 4 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/565003\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T23:11:42-07:00","id":1155307,"title":"","content":"<b><u>One Hour Ago</u></b><br /> Constable Michael Franklin, pious soldier of God with blood demon in his veins, comes forth in front of Dean Jaeger.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cSir, we must believe in God\u2019s plan for us. We will find the soul guilty of this crimes, whenever he is or not spawn of the Hell. You say about library awash in blood. What do you mean about it? Is it the place this crime took place?\u201d</span><br /> <br /> He pauses to look over Stephanie and continuing her thought.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cKnowing name of the poor soul that left this vale of tears would hasten our investigation.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> <b><u>Present</u></b><br /> Constable Franklin is nearing his oil lamp to the writing on the wall. He tries to remember the symbol and it\u2019s meaning that made his body to respond in such forceful way.<br /> <br /> <i>Rolling Intelligence + Occult to recognize symbol \u2013 with -3 penalty for not having Occult, I start with -1 die. But Micheal focus very hard to understand the sign \u2013 I burn 1 Willpower for the roll, ending with dicepool of 2. And\u2026</i><br /> <br /> <i>I got success!</i><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <u>2d10o10h8</u>: <b>1</b> [2d10o10h8=8, 4]<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565004#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565004#\" target=\"_blank\"> Dice Roller &bull; Orokos.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565004#\" target=\"_blank\"> https://orokos.com/roll/565004# </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Orokos is a tool site for role-playing games, such as Dungeons and Dragons 4th edition, allowing players to upload characters from Wizards of the Coast's Character Builder program and providing a dice roller and attribute calculator. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-03-2017, 02:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T23:16:25-07:00","id":1155308,"title":"","content":"<u>One Hour Ago</u><br /> &quot;Not as such. The night is last and dark, it gives us a cover to act freely before the rest of the constabulary truely knows what is going on. Further, there are signs of Black Magic having been used. I'd rather not expose anyone who hasn't taken up the Vigil already. This seems potent...possibly a demon summoning gone wrong. If possession could be at play, it's best to limit exposure, which precludes trying to figure out who the body used to belong to before setting your cell to work, henceforth, I called on you immediately. Of course, it would only be proper for you to establish identity, especially if it leads to our occult killer.&quot;<br /> <br /> <u>Present</u><br /> <br /> Stephe looks at one of the fingers. The wound is rough and stretched. The knuckle joint is fully intact, and there's no sign of cut marks. These fingers were pulled straight out of their sockets. Judging by the amount of blood, it happened before the statue finished this poor soul off.<br /> <br /> Brian doesn't flinch at the scene, just glares at it disgustedly. <br /> <br /> &quot;Lord above, no human could have used that statue to commit a killing. Either we're dealing with something truly horrific, or the Dean's right and there's a demon out there possessing folks.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T23:21:22-07:00","id":1155309,"title":"","content":"<u>Present</u><br /> Micheal recognizes the symbol, but just barely, he's only heard of it vaguely meantioned. This is the infamous Yellow Sign, the symbol of a Demon King who rules bizarre hell called Carcosa. The sign is usually found associated with theatres.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T23:41:30-07:00","id":1155314,"title":"","content":"Stephanie feels the acid sensation of fury boiling up in her chest. She puts the finger down with surprising delicacy.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Torture. This was no tryst gone sour. The killing was the idea. Brian has the right of it.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Her eyes linger on Brian. He's a strange one. That hollow look resonates with her in ways she couldn't explain to the rest of the cell.<br /> <br /> She steps out of the room for a breath of fresh air. Out in the courtyard, she speaks quietly with a sticky-fingered porter she pulled aside earlier. Who's been here tonight?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Invoking Contacts (Organized Crime) to ask a fellow criminal on the Miskatonic campus whether any familiar faces have been lurking in the area. Was this a hit someone knew about? Has anyone known to local criminals been around?<br /> <br /> Manipulation 2+Streetwise 3, 5 dice: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/565007\" target=\"_blank\">fail.</a> Do Beats matter in this scenario? Only if something interesting and valuable to the playtest would come of it, I'll make this a dramatic failure.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T23:46:36-07:00","id":1155315,"title":"","content":"<b><u>One Hour Ago</u></b><br /> Micheal continuous discussion with Dean.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cIf we are talking about demon summoning or possession, maybe you could point us on dangers of it. What lore of Lucifuge tells about those threats? What could be weak points of the monster?\u201d </span><br /> <br /> <b><u>Present</u></b><br /> Micheal focus to think about last time he saw the sign in the Colonies. Maybe in Arkham Theater, on last season\u2019s plays?<br /> <br /> <i>Rolling Intelligence + Academics to recognize Yellow Sign \u2013 or something connected to it - in theaters play. I roll 4 dices then\u2026</i><br /> <br /> <i>And no luck.</i> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <u>4d10o10h8</u>: <b>0</b> [4d10o10h8=5, 6, 5, 2]<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565009\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565009\" target=\"_blank\"> Dice Roller &bull; Orokos.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565009\" target=\"_blank\"> https://orokos.com/roll/565009 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Orokos is a tool site for role-playing games, such as Dungeons and Dragons 4th edition, allowing players to upload characters from Wizards of the Coast's Character Builder program and providing a dice roller and attribute calculator. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-03-2017, 03:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T02:05:47-07:00","id":1155330,"title":"","content":"<b><u>One Hour Ago</u></b><br /> Cassidy sat in silence, nervously looking, her arms and legs are crossed. She was annoyed from the Dean's over poetic language, disliked Stephanie's attitude toward the instance, and hated Michael's self righteousness- who was he to tell God what were his plans? She never truly trusted her cellmates, and they they didn't really trusted her &quot;lack of motivation in the war against the devil&quot;. And worse of all- she didn't trusted herself, for when Michael has verified that the act was done through a supernatural act, her blood stirred. Suddenly, she had a strong urge to see the demon, to see the spawn of hell which came and brought a rain of blood upon earth. Was that her inner devil? Was that her own, tainted soul? She didn't knew- and so, she simply set there in silence.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Present</u></b><br /> Cassidy looked at the murder scene. She sniffed the air, filling her lungs with the heavy scent of blood. Some part of her mind felt truly sorry for the death of the nameless man before her. Another has calmly wondered if the murderer used the statue as a weapon in order to give a message, or was it simply because it was the most available tool to do the job. And deep down, she felt.. excited. A coppery taste filled her mouth, her fingers trembled with excitement. She stood before the sign, seemingly examining the image- but in truth, she simply tried to think what to do. Unlike her friends, who had to rely on actually searching the room for evidence, Hell has gifted her with a number of ways to see its taint upon the world- each having its own advantages.. and disadvantages. Which path should she take? Should she even turn to Hell's help at such time? She wanted her sister to be with her so much right now..<br /> <br /> She took a breath, and scent of blood calmed her right away. She had a job to do- and more important than that, she knew what she wanted to do. She wanted to see the demon, lifting the marble statue from the ground with infernal power. She wanted to see the scenery of hell reaching out to the world, raining blood and brimstone upon the world. She wanted to paint a picture.<br /> <br /> Reaching to her equipment, she drew out a pencil and the notebook she used to practice her sketching skills. She stood near the statue, as if she was drawing the crime scene- but she didn't. Instead, she took a big breath of bloody air, closed her eyes, and invited Hell to her mind. It was the time to draw the demon of blood and death.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> activating Infernal Visions- Wits + Composure, 7d10o10h8. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/565036\" target=\"_blank\">2 Successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T09:59:44-07:00","id":1155433,"title":"","content":"<u>One Hour Ago</u><br /> <br /> Khalil lit the spill from one of the candles, watching the small flame intently as he brought it to his pipe. Glancing directly at Michael, he calmly spoke up. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I do not think we shall be able to determine the weak points of our foe prior to its identification. The hordes of Hell contain great variety among their ranks. Once we know our enemy, my library will certainly provide the information we require.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <u>Present</u><br /> <br /> Khalil took the crime scene in at a glance, his eyes focusing immediately upon the sigil and the message written beneath it. Let the others focus on the poor dead bastard. He was confident that the answers they sought would be contained there. He strode directly to the sigil, studying it intently.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Rolling Intelligence + Occult, with 9-Again since Occult is an Asset Skill. Results: <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">7d10o9h8</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">: </span></span><b>1</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> [7d10o9h8=7, 8, 7, 1, 2, 4, 5]</span></span> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565207\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/565207</a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T14:50:06-07:00","id":1155548,"title":"","content":"<b><u>One Hour Ago</u></b><br /> <br /> Micheal wants to hasten his cellmates.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cIf we are not given more information about crime \u2013 we should move to the place of death. God has shown he have plan for us, you do not made Almighty waiting. We are on the Vigil, on Christ's wounds!\u201d </span><br /> <br /> <b><u>Present</u></b><br /> <br /> Micheal stands next to Khalil near the wall, pointing to the sign.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cKhalil, do you see this? I recognize this spark in your eyes - you know what this infernal symbol means, yes? \u201d </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T18:24:14-07:00","id":1155610,"title":"","content":"<u>One Hour Ago</u><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Indeed, my friend. There is nothing to be gained here.&quot; </span>Khalil rose to leave.<br /> <br /> <u>Present</u><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I do,&quot;</span> Khalil said, wracking his brain to recall as much as he could about it.<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> &quot;It is the Yellow Sign. The Demon King of Carcosa is clearly connected to this in some manner...&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I assumed that I'd gain the same information that Michael did, since it was the same number of successes on the same roll. Khalil would be attempting to recall as much as he could about Carcosa and its Demon King. I'm rolling the previous dice pool again to reflect a focus upon his past studies, but if the previous roll shows the most that he could remember without consulting his books, this one can just be disregarded. <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">7d10o9h8</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">: </span></span><b>4</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> [7d10o9h8=3, 8, 4, 8, 1, [9, 1], 8]</span></span> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565367\" target=\"_blank\">https://orokos.com/roll/565367</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T22:27:56-07:00","id":1155650,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><u><b>Present</b></u><br /> Getting a breath of fresh air outside of the library, Steph is able to find two river runners finishing up their rounds on the University\u2019s campus, delivering rum, wine, and other illicit substances that would otherwise get them run out of town by a mob of Puritans. They\u2019ve barely seen anyone all evening, they can account for the cell, but almost no one else. They did see Gabby snooping around earlier, but they had assumed that she and Steph had cooked up some sort of scheme together.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Back in the library, Caddidy is hard at work drawing. She sees a woman with a knife, carving words into a priest\u2019s chest. She sees the woman, dipping her fingers in the blood pooled under the crushed body. She sees the blood being used to paint the Yellow Sign on the wall. Cassidy knows this woman or knows her as well as she knows her cellmates. It is Gabby, Steph\u2019s estranged lover and Brian\u2019s current employer at the docks. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Meanwhile, Brian growls in a low voice as he removes his doublet. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u201cWill you help me move this bloody hunk of rock lads? We may as well find out who\u2019s underneath.\u201d </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">As Michael helps Brian, Khalil takes another look at the Yellow Sign, and this time it does move! Suddenly, the room appears to be empty and shrouded in darkness that is only penetrated by the pulsing light of the Yellow Sign, which is wrapping its tentacles around the entire walls and ceiling. A figure steps into the gloom, draped in rotten yellow robes so that all you can see is the ivory mask covering its face. Before the Professor can do anything the figure speaks, and its words carry the air fate and a royal pronouncement with them. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u201cI wear no mask.\u201d </span></b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The Khalil is back in the room with his cell, just as Micheal and Brian tip King Willam off of the body. If there was any doubt, now it is removed. The victim was Father Julius, the Anglican priest Micheal had one saved. His clothes are torn open, exposing the bright red words carved in his chest. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:26px\"><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">HAVE YE HEARD THE OCHRE PRINCE? </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">HAVE YE MET THE KING IN YELLOW?</span></span></b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Khalil hears the degenerate voice in his head once more, but no one else seems to. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u201cHow much of Miriam do you think will be left by the end of this?\u201d </span></b></span><br /> <br /> [OOC]<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Steph, Khalil, and Michael each take a beat. Micheal must roll a breaking point for losing his Touchstone. Keep in mind that this imposes a -2 penalty on the roll. Khalil gains the Spooked Condition due to what he saw and must roll a breaking point for encountering a demon for the first time. Cassidy gains the Shaken Condition as part of her backlash, but also gains the Informed Condition relevant to Gabby.</span></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 11-04-2017, 10:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T23:50:00-07:00","id":1155659,"title":"","content":"<b><u>Present</u></b><br /> Micheal suddenly drops on his knees before body of dead friend. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> \u201cGood God! Father Julius! Those demon spawns have taken you from your holy mission! I\u2026 I\u2026 cannot\u2026 \u201c</span><br /> <br /> [OOC]<br /> As Micheal is losing his only Touchstone, so I can decide to automatically lower his Integrity by dot \u2013 or not lost Integrity dot, but gaining Persistent Condition instead. I choose to take Persistent version of Vendetta Condtion for this.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> \u201cI\u2026 I must avenge you, my friend. You are victim of the war with Evil, but your sacrifice will not \u2013 cannot \u2013 gone in vain! I will hunt this Hell spawn that did this to you, even If that would be last thing I ever do!\u201d </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-04-2017, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T00:39:46-07:00","id":1155662,"title":"","content":"<b><u>One Hour Ago</u></b><br /> Cassidy had to hold herself from rolling her eyes. Michael kept talking about God and His plans as if he was God's personal prophet. It must be nice, she thought to herself, to be able to find such comfort in faith- even though you are damned.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Present</u></b><br /> The images flowed through her, like a river of flames which spilled to the page. The pencil danced beneath her fingers, moving like a spider and turning the visions the Hell has revealed to her into a solid image. While she was drawing, she started mumbling to herself, her eyes see the horrifying scene coming into life on the blank page. <span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Not the Son of Beast</span>&quot; she whispered &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">But the Daughter of Eve. She came upon the Son of God. Stab, stab, stab- blood flows, the King falls, a sign in drawn upon the wall. She has turned away from light</span>&quot; she looked at Michael with hazed eyes &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">No more confessions he shall speak tonight</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> She felt terrible. Not only because of the visions- she was used to the touch that Hell had upon her soul. The memory of her mocking thought about Michael's faith has filled her with guilt, as she looked at him kneeling before the priest's crushed body. While she did felt sorrow and dread, a calmer, colder part of her mind started to analyze the information, reaching into two conclusions. First, Gabby was many things- but she was no demon. The acts of pulling fingers out of place or throwing marble statues was not something she should have been able to do. That may mean that Gabby was possessed- or worse, has turned into a monster. However, it doesn't reveals why she has committed the act- sure, demons were never big supporters of holy men, but it was clear that the demon tries to pass a message. Why?<br /> <br /> The second thing she understood was that the information was, in fact, a pile of gunpowder waiting to explode. Gabby would probably deny her lover being the murderer, and Brian would also try to protect his employer. After all, even if one were to disregard emotional attachments, if Gabby was possessed it would immediately make them into the suspects in the act. Michael, however, was an whole other problem. He has just swore an oath to avenge his priest- and in such state, he may not make the difference between the demon and the mortal, and the last thing they needed at a time like that was an internal strife.<br /> <br /> <i>Oh, Melissa, where are you?</i> she thought to herself. She shook her head, closed her notebook with trembling fingers and returned it to its place. There was only one path open before her- reaching to the only neutral person in the room and hope he would see beyond her low place in the conspiracy. She walked to Khalil, softly touched his arm and whispered &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">I know who the killer is- even if not the murderer</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T02:09:05-07:00","id":1155671,"title":"","content":"Steph returns to the library a while later, nursing a dull ache in her spirit. Gabby? Here? Tonight? Why?<br /> <br /> Looks like the victim has been discovered: the priest whom Michael kept in confidence. She blasphemes: <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;God's blood! The wolf's taken a lamb from our own flock!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Not even the Lucifuge can make her respect the cloth. She conceives of God more as a cruel and mighty general, surveying the endless battles fought in his name with a crown of fury, than anything the Anglicans or Puritans worship. But she understands that Michael was close to Father Julius, and those attachments keep hunters hunting, and therefore their cell has been wronged. Vengeance gives the Hunt meaning. It looks like Michael gets it now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T03:11:02-07:00","id":1155679,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Rolling Khalil's breaking point: <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">6d10o10h8</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">: </span></span><b>2</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> [6d10o10h8=6, 1, 5, 8, 7, 8] </span></span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">https://orokos.com/roll/565428 I think that I'll give him the Stoic Condition. </span></span></span></div></div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Khalil stared at the sigil, but he was no longer seeing it. <i>Miriam? But she has nothing to do with any of this... </i>He tried to make sense out of everything he'd just glimpsed, but his mind kept returning to the last thing he'd heard.He needed to figure this out quickly.. For her. </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;No mask... Ochre Prince... King in Yellow...&quot;</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> Entangled in his thoughts, he did not notice Cassidy's approach. As her hand touched him, he jumped a little. Quickly putting on a brave face, he turned to Cassidy. </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;Tell me...&quot;</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> he said quietly.</span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T03:30:03-07:00","id":1155682,"title":"","content":"Cassidy was about to answer to Khalil, when she noticed that Stephanie has just entered the library. Worst time ever, she thought to herself. She has started to see danger everywhere- the shadows became darker, the air became thicker. What if Stephanie was the traitor? How would she react to her accusing Gabby for the act? Can she trust Khalil? Can she trust anyone?.. <br /> <br /> She took a breath to get over the touch of Hell, and nervously pulled her notebook and pencil out, opening it at the sketch of her vision. &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">That's what Hell has showed me</span>&quot; she said, and then scribbled a single word next to Gabby's bloody picture- <i>possession?</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T03:58:57-07:00","id":1155687,"title":"","content":"Like bird of prey, Micheal suddenly turns his head to Cassidy. Anger shows on his face and he goes in the instant over the scetch artist.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;SHOW ME!&quot; </span> - he demand in the tone that not accepts refusal. <br /> <br /> [OCC] <br /> I need to Intimidate Cassidy by rolls or anything?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T07:59:59-07:00","id":1155730,"title":"","content":"It has been an intense night for Cassidy. The hour was late, she witnessed the butchered corpse of a priest, allowed her mind to be touched by Hell for answers and had to deal with a very complicated, explosive situation. Having Micheal covered in blood jumping upon her like a madman was more than she could have handled- she shrieked, her precious notebook falling on the floor, and recoiled into a position behind Khalil, putting him between herself and Micheal. It took her a moment to regain her composure and free herself from the infernal touch on her mind, but it was one moment too late. Suddenly, anger filled her heart- on herself for acting like a little child, on Micheal for putting her in that position, on the Dean for sending her to that damned investigation, on the Gabby for murdering people and on the priest for getting murdered. She gave an harsh, hateful look at Micheal and hissed the last sentence from her vision.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">No more confessions he shall speak tonight</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T08:01:48-07:00","id":1155731,"title":"","content":"Brian curses at the body of the priest. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Devil's horns. This was no chance that the murder happened in the library! The killer is attacking us, personally, by attacking our attachments to humanity. This isn't some demon looking to cause mischief. This is a matter of blood and family!&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T10:26:14-07:00","id":1155777,"title":"","content":"Khalil stooped to retrieve the book. After a moment's hesitation, he offered it to Michael. He deserved to know. &quot;She may be possessed,&quot; he said. &quot;We must apprehend and imprison her, so that we may learn the truth.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T12:33:46-07:00","id":1155817,"title":"","content":"Brian's interpretation, even if it's colored by his own recent loss, makes good sense to Steph. It plays into her sense of being aggrieved. &quot;Blood and family&quot; is right.<br /> <br /> She's on edge, fingers curling and uncurling around her dagger. The drama around Cassidy's notebook is worrying. She doesn't look over Michael's shoulder, she just narrows her eyes and asks: &quot;Who's possessed?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T16:09:34-07:00","id":1155884,"title":"","content":"Micheal evidently calms himself when taking book from Khalil. We tries to suppress his anger, knowing that it\u2019s not his cellmates are responsible for Father Julius death. Deep down inside his heart he listen to tiny voice that it\u2019s Micheal himself who did not protected his friend and confident\u2026<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cI\u2019m\u2026\u201d </span> \u2013 He turns his head to Cassidy \u2013 <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> \u201cI\u2019m sorry. Sorry for my outburst. I\u2019m just so angry that this\u2026</span> &quot;- He looks inside a book onto sketches \u2013 &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">This\u2026 thing\u2026 killed so innocent and pious men like Father Julius. I know it\u2019s literally Satan\u2019s work \u2013 or one of his servants \u2013 but it still burns inside me. It only point\u2019s that Scripture was right and we cannot let any Evil to live inside our community.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Micheal looks on the women depicted on the sketch. His eyes flint in some unsettling way for others to see\u2026","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T16:36:13-07:00","id":1155887,"title":"","content":"Brian takes the sketch. He grimaces stoically as his eyes trace over the page. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;It's Gabby, Steph. Gabby's the one who did this...&quot;</span> he manages before his voice dies in his throat. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;We have to get moving. This is only going to get worse before it gets better.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T18:17:41-07:00","id":1155908,"title":"","content":"Stephanie stares unfeelingly at Julius' corpse. Her fingers reach unconsciously between the buttons of her coat and grasp the otherworldly fabric of her Lemurian armor.<br /> <br /> Then she says: &quot;Liar. No- just a fool. Ignoramus!&quot;<br /> <br /> She paces, extremely Not Mad.<br /> <br /> &quot;Impossible. Meaningless scribbles. God's hooks, Cass can't even handle her own infernal blood! A vision spoken by Lucifer's own blackened lips, drawn by a whelp with milk still on her teeth- and you think it's true as Scripture! We're in a schoolhouse, for godsake- use your reason! My little-&quot;<br /> <br /> Her voice catches. &quot;th-the little bird couldn't knock a statue down, infernal whispers or none! She hasn't strayed that far from the nest! Listen to yourselves: a bloody corpse and a whiff of brimstone, and you go half-mad!&quot;<br /> <br /> She fingers her knife with a trembling hand. &quot;You think I can't keep a firm hand on my woman?&quot;<br /> <br /> Thinking about the estrangement through the lens of the Hunt is about the first time she's spoken of it in front of the cell. Losing Gabby to demonic forces is about the worst fate she can imagine.<br /> <br /> &quot;The killer's probably after her next, and here we are casting aspersions- enough with it! We'll track her down first and catch the devil flat-footed. Come on, then!&quot;<br /> <br /> Steph sheathes her dagger and turns to storm out of the room. Gabby's been around tonight, she can't be that far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-04T22:15:34-07:00","id":1155949,"title":"","content":"Cassidy practically ignored Michael's apology. Somewhere deep in here she knew he was truly sorry, but in here eyes, apology should be done with acts, and not words. She cringed as Steph called her vision &quot;meaningless scribbles&quot;, but that was more or less what she has expected. Beside, there were some more urgent matters- if Brian was right, her sister was in danger. She reached to Brian and coldly said &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">my sketchbook</span>&quot;.<br /> <br /> Family and blood, she mused.<br /> <br /> What if that demon was family too?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T11:00:06-08:00","id":1156096,"title":"","content":"[OoC] I'm going to skip back to the Dean so that we keep things moving. I'm hoping we can get to Scene 3 before the feedback period closes on the 10th. If there is anything you want to do before meeting with him, just make note of it in the same post.<br /> <br /> Dean Jaegar is deeply disturbed by your findings. <br /> <br /> &quot;We cannot stand by when the Lucifuge and its kin are under attack. Save Gabby if you can, but we must put this demon down. I had planned to to do this after you had successfully closed this investigation, but now it seems you need all of the power at your disposal to survive. Steph, Micheal, you have earned the right to unlock deeper secrets from your blood. Please bear with me, I will make the ritual as expeditious as I can.&quot;<br /> <br /> Normally unleashing a new endowment is a ritual filled with pomp for Arkham's Lucifuge. There is none of that here. The Dean gathers a crucible of sulphur and quicksilver, spills his blood in it, adds Steph and Micheal's blood before lighting the entire thing on fire. The entire room fills with the rank smell of flesh and brimstone. Your eyes water and you nearly wretch, but Steph and Micheal are left feeling the rush of power in their veins. <br /> <br /> [OoC] <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Steph gains access to the Shackles of Pandemonium. Micheal gains access to Falsehood's Heir. You both suffer a breaking point for gaining power from an obvious supernatural source. Keep in mind at you may trade away this breaking point in favour of altering the Code. If you roll the breaking point, take a beat.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Move quick. Move quietly. We must put this to an end now. May God be with you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T12:07:20-08:00","id":1156113,"title":"","content":"<u>OoC</u><br /> I'm going under the assumption that Khalil and/or Micheal has shared the information they got about the Yellow Sign with the rest of the cell in the time skip. Correct me if it is not the case.<br /> <br /> Cassidy had to coldly watched at the Dean as he endowed, from her point of view, the two most unreliable members of the cell. She wasn't jealous- Hell has &quot;gifted&quot; her more than enough, whether she wanted it or not- but she was yet to forgive the two for their reaction in the murder scene. While Steph and Micheal got their reward for their bad behavior, she softly touched Khalil's hand to draw his attention, and then whispered &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">that.. that demon. The King in Yellow. You said it is connected to theaters...</span>&quot; she took a pause in order to decide how to express her thoughts, and then added &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">If it was a play, and Father Jacob's murder was the first act- how you would have written the next scene?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T12:26:03-08:00","id":1156117,"title":"","content":"[OoC] Micheal is not ready to acknowledge he is \u2018Son of Devil\u2019, especially when he just vow to avenge killing of his confident Father Julius from the claws of demon. He will take Beat and roll on Breaking Point.<br /> <br /> He has Resolve 2, Composure 3 and gaining inhuman Endowment is a Point with -2 penalty. BUT rolling any Breaking Point without having any Touchstone is also -2 penalty. So Micheal roll with only 1 die on Breaking Point\u2026<br /> <br /> He got no success. <u>1d10o10h8</u>: <b>0</b> [1d10o10h8=5]<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565877\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565877\" target=\"_blank\"> Dice Roller &bull; Orokos.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/565877\" target=\"_blank\"> https://orokos.com/roll/565877 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Orokos is a tool site for role-playing games, such as Dungeons and Dragons 4th edition, allowing players to upload characters from Wizards of the Coast's Character Builder program and providing a dice roller and attribute calculator. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Seeing how his world is crushing and Dean is forcing his inhumanity on him \u2013 I think he swing more in to going over with indulgence in his demonic side to resolve vengeance quickier. I take Dramatic Failure from this roll and take <i>Violent</i> Condtion for Micheal. I mark 2 Beats from rolling Breaking Point and taking Dramatic Failure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-05-2017, 03:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T12:38:50-08:00","id":1156123,"title":"","content":"[IC] After words and signs made by Dean, Micheal looks aloof. In his eyes is reflected shadow of the Hell \u2013 eternal fire that is burning in his heart, however he tries to quench it. But now there is no one to calm him. No one to control him. The man that was his moral guide in the life of Lucifuge, his friend \u2013 is dead. And so, let the world burn with the fires of Inferno he has in his veins. He maybe tries to be God\u2019s soldier in his army against Darkness \u2013 but, in the end, Micheal is the demonic half-spawn, at least in part from the Pit. And so he will show that Hell hath no fury greater by it\u2019s own on God\u2019s mission - he will bring Hell to this wretched from Hell itself!<br /> <br /> However, to his cellmates he just calmly says:<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201d Let\u2019s track this thing and send from where it come from.\u201d </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T15:26:54-08:00","id":1156172,"title":"","content":"Khalil didn't take his eyes off the ritual. He felt no jealousy that he was not included in it, but he did find it fascinating to watch. Particularly the flames. He whispered his response to Cassidy without removing his attention from the rite. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Escalation,&quot;</span> he said. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Further tragedies along the same theme. Greater secrets shall be learned, and the fear for the characters' safety intensifies. This shall get worse before it gets better. I pray this show has only two acts.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <i>My sweet Miriam...</i> he thought. <i>Are you threatened by this demon? Should I run to you? Would doing so keep you safe? Or would it merely lead the beast to your door? </i>Khalil did not voice his fears aloud, resisting the urge to seek out his precious Miriam. If he was going to keep her safe, he knew his best chance was to catch their foe quickly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T03:36:27-08:00","id":1156273,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">posted yesterday but it still hasn't shown up. Steph sidesteps the breaking point by replacing &quot;gain power from a monstrous source&quot; with &quot;being defeated by another wielder of infernal power.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T12:49:17-08:00","id":1156442,"title":"","content":"Cassidy slowly nods to Khalil's words and says &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">I think I need access to your books. If it is truly a play, maybe it is not the premiere. If that all happened before..</span>&quot; she clasped her hands. They had to end this incident before someone else would get hurt. Before her sister will get hurt. She took a breath and then continued &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">And even if not, that demon has acted before. We may find a pattern so we could catch Gabby</span>&quot; she glanced at Micheal &quot;before it will be too late&quot;<br /> <br /> After hearing Micheal's proclaim, she added in a silent voice, more to herself than anyone else &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">If I were to write this tragedy, I would have made sure that Gabby would never be taken alive. Someone has to be blamed for her death. That way, when the stakes would be high, the hurt lover would betray her family, and end up damning her own soul. That how I would have written a tragedy of family and blood</span>&quot; she looked at the flames, trapped inside her own thought &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">that would be a fine tragedy, I believe</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T13:54:25-08:00","id":1156467,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;My library is at your disposal,&quot;</span> Khalil said. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I have every confidence that we shall find great insight within my sources.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T21:33:55-08:00","id":1156569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1155285-ic-hunter-the-vigil-2e-playtest-the-lucifuge-s-doubting-souls?p=1156442#post1156442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">If I were to write this tragedy, I would have made sure that Gabby would never be taken alive. Someone has to be blamed for her death. That way, when the stakes would be high, the hurt lover would betray her family, and end up damning her own soul. That how I would have written a tragedy of family and blood...that would be a fine tragedy, I believe</span>&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Steph narrows her eyes. Cassidy's whispers about this infernal play stir a dim sense of recognition, but she doesn't quite put the pieces together. She leans over to Brian and murmurs: <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Who's she talking about?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Still, she trudges along to Khalil's library to give some insight into the research. She knows Gabby as well as anybody. Of course she does. She should be able to draw the connection between this imagined play and the physical streets of Arkham that Gabby might walk.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Teamwork action to support Cassidy and Khalil. Manipulation+Streetwise: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/566473\" target=\"_blank\">1 success.</a> +1 die to the primary actor.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T22:02:07-08:00","id":1156580,"title":"","content":"Micheal, tense but acting unrealistically calmly, focus his will and forces single sentence, helping his cellmates.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cThose are demons \u2013 maybe Scripture will have answers.\u201d </span> \u2013 And he takes his Bible, starting to read for clues about Enemy in there.<br /> <br /> [OoC] Teamwork helping Cassidy and Khalil. Rolling Intelligence + Academics + Specialization in Scripture, so 5 dices in poll\u2026<br /> And he adds +3 bonus to primary actor. <u>5d10o10h8</u>: <b>3</b> [5d10o10h8=9, 7, 9, 9, 5]<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/566475\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/566475\" target=\"_blank\"> Dice Roller &bull; Orokos.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://orokos.com/roll/566475\" target=\"_blank\"> https://orokos.com/roll/566475 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Orokos is a tool site for role-playing games, such as Dungeons and Dragons 4th edition, allowing players to upload characters from Wizards of the Coast's Character Builder program and providing a dice roller and attribute calculator. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T12:23:47-08:00","id":1156759,"title":"","content":"Cassidy set in front of the desk like a giant spider, weaving patterns as if they were strings. Next to here, Steph recalled everything she knew and thought was important about Gabby, her habits and the streets of Arkahm. On the other side of the table, Micheal was investigating holy texts in search for the behavior of the infernal Host, and Khalil searched for any bit of information he could about the mysterious King in Yellow. In front of her, there was a map of Arkham, together with books about its history, past crimes and supernatural incidents, as well as texts which speak about previous manifestations of the King, or demons similar or related to it.<br /> <br /> From that vast wealth of information, she tried to find connections, crack patterns, discover the truth which was hidden beneath the surface- and all of those texts were centered around a single picture. The sketch of her vision. She searched the infernal image for any signs she may have found about the possible next move of Gabby and the demon which may have possessed her. While that mission may have been difficult, she had a special.. talent to deal with such case. Hell knew the souls of the sinners, and it has taught her how they may think and act. There was a price to pay, of course- no one can walk the mind of a madman and leave unscratched- but she had to stop the next murder. Innocent lives were at stake. Her sister's lives were at stake.<br /> <br /> She looked on a blank page of her sketchbook, her pencil in her hand, and then said &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">If I were to write this play- what tragedy would I write?</span>&quot;<br /> <br /> And with those words, she started to draw.<br /> <br /> <u>OOC</u><br /> Cassidy is shedding the Informed Condition about Gabby in order to find out her murder pattern, and where should is likely to strike next. That means that a failure would turn into success, and success into an exceptional success. She also activate the Mind of a Madman, which grants her the 8 again- it may not be necessary, but using a dream to save lives is one of her Aspirations, and it would make sense she would use the ability in such time, and would make her a lot more likely to break. She would also utilize Steph's help, but as Micheal got more successes it should be better he would devout them to Khalil's efforts.<br /> <br /> As it she is trying to crack the pattern, I roll for Wits+Investigation+1 from Steph. That gives her a dicepool of 6. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/566641\" target=\"_blank\">failure</a>, but thanks to the Informed, it is considered a 1 Success.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T13:18:34-08:00","id":1156776,"title":"","content":"Khalil tore through his library, snatching every tome that might prove useful and laying it out on the desk. He began pouring through the texts for any information he could find on the demon, leaving Cassidy and Steph to puzzle out Gabby's next move. As he read a passage in one faded tome and quickly skimmed the relevant passages from the scriptures provided by Michael, his mind began to piece together the legends of the King in Yellow. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;By God, I think we've got something.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Int 3 + Occult 4 + Library 2 + 3 from Michael + 1 Folklore Specialty. Looks like whether the Specialty applied or not didn't matter, given that the last die was a 5. It seems that both Library and scripture came in handy, though.</span></span> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">13d10o9h8</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">: </span></span><b>4</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> [13d10o9h8=3, 3, 4, 7, 7, 6, 4, [10, 2], 8, 8, 3, [9, 2], 5] </span></span>https://orokos.com/roll/566655</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T13:45:42-08:00","id":1157113,"title":"","content":"Cassidy thinks she recognizes a potential pattern. If Gabby killed the Priest, she could be after the people that the cell holds dear enough to ground them in reality (OOC: aka their Touchstones). It is likely another of these people will be her next target. <br /> <br /> Khalil discovers that the King in Yellow is a demon lord from the hell-city of Carcosa, which is paradoxically under the earth and in the stars. His cult is not well known in Arkham or the colonies but is closely associated with Paris in the Old World. He is best known for the play that shares his name, which is known for causing madness in those that read it. If the play has made its way into Arkham, you have a bigger problem on your hands than just one demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T14:47:43-08:00","id":1157128,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;The King in Yellow refers to more than just the demon lord of Carcosa! It is also the title of a play. A play that drives readers to madness. The King in Yellow's cult is practically unheard of here in the colonies, but a play is easily transported. If someone is unaware of what they are reading, they may be driven mad before they realize their peril! If this play is being distributed here... As much as I hate to say it, the events of tonight may be a mere prologue to the coming dangers.&quot; </span>Khalil took a calming breath. He wasn't certain whether they'd be able to help anyone who had come in contact with the accursed play, but he didn't know whether it would be best to mention this just yet. Still, if the play was the problem, his infernal blood would give him the perfect solution to prevent it from harming any others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T15:21:09-08:00","id":1157138,"title":"","content":"Micheal become uptight. All over his body, muscle tense and his face grimaced. He takes his right hand and hit hard with a fist in the table!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> \u201cWhere does it leads us! How we \u2013 in the name of Lord \u2013 are there to beat the play in theater?!\u201d </span> \u2013 He watched into Khalil eyes like he would be his enemy, for split second. Then he stands up and act like it was mistake, looking over the room and walking - <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201d How are we to find a demon that spreads by some fairy tale?!\u201d </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T16:48:36-08:00","id":1157151,"title":"","content":"Steph raises a hand as Michael fumes. She likes this side of him, perverse though it is.<br /> <br /> &quot;'The play's the thing to catch the demon called the King.' Heard that in a London theatre once. Point is: if we're part of the scheme now, we'll see the devil ourselves soon. My blood can make the devil dance, Carcosa or no. Whatever this demon is, it'll have a rude surprise once we're in the same room. I still say we ought to find Gabby first, but if Miriam's close by, let's collect her, too. Just be quick about it!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T20:55:27-08:00","id":1157184,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Oh, my precious Miriam...&quot;</span> Khalil said quietly. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;She knows nothing of any of this... Ignorance is bliss... Do I take that from her? Do I force her to see the world for what it is? What I am? Do I dare do anything else?&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T21:12:08-08:00","id":1157186,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ignorance won't keep her safe,&quot; Steph counsels, hypocritically in light her rift with Gabby. &quot;If the whelp has it right, she's already been put in danger. Seeing flames at your fingertips won't make things any worse. If she's precious to you, save her first and worry about your relationship later.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T22:10:11-08:00","id":1157195,"title":"","content":"Cassidy barge to the conversation and says &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Steph is right. Whatever took over Gabby will target Miriam next</span>&quot; she examine her painting, looking at the two women which came to life under her pencil &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">and my sister, too. We have to find them both and bring them here. Worry not</span>&quot; she looked at Steph with a crooked smile &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Gabby will come to us</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T00:18:01-08:00","id":1157211,"title":"","content":"Micheal, controlling boiling in his rage comes to simple statements:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;So let's end talking and go to action - God's work is waiting for us! We need to run for your close ones. Let's hunt some demons!&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T01:35:49-08:00","id":1157220,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;You are all correct,&quot;</span> Khalil said with a sigh. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Better that she learn the truth of the world from my lips than... than the hard way,&quot;</span> he finished. He wouldn't speak his fears aloud.<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> &quot;I shall go to fetch her from her home at once.&quot;</span> With that said, Khalil strode purposefully towards the door, determined to seek out his betrothed before his resolve failed him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T02:26:20-08:00","id":1157223,"title":"","content":"Cassidy cursed at Khalil's impulsive reaction. He was the only one she thought had a decent amount of common sense, and now it looked like even that went to hell. While she never liked being in charge, someone had to maintain a cool mind and actually make a plan.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Micheal!</span>&quot; she called &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">go with Khalil to fetch Miriam. Steph- you should come with me to fetch my sister.</span>&quot; she had to separate the two explosive cellmates from each other- or else all would be lose. It was a gamble- as she, the lowest in their ranks, has started to giving orders. Will they listen to her? who knows. She had to try and stop the tragedy from coming true &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">we shall meet in here in one hour, and then bring the two to our safe place. Brian...</span>&quot; she looked around her &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">where the hell is Brian?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 11-09-2017, 05:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T14:12:47-08:00","id":1157353,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Right here,&quot;</span> Brian says from behind Cassidy, <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I will come with you unless we want to take the even less tactically sound route of splitting the ranks even further. By God's Blood, we will put an end to this chase tonight!&quot; </span>He doesn't seem to care about her opinions of his usefulness, and dissuading him will be difficult.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T14:18:14-08:00","id":1157356,"title":"","content":"Cassidy gave a sharp glance at Brian and replied &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">I agree. We leave now</span>&quot; and then went right out of the door without looking back. She had to trust her cellmate to follow her commands, and that they would think she was as confident in herself as she tried to act. One false move, and they would treat her as the &quot;whelp&quot; they think she is. Her hands shake, her throat was dry- but she carried on. With the help of both God and the Devil, no more innocent blood would be spilled tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T14:54:26-08:00","id":1157367,"title":"","content":"Steph watches Khalil and Cassidy leave in separate directions, leaving her alone with the other two spiritually wounded masculine hunters. She arms herself with a hunting bow and slings a quiver over her shoulder, then raises a fist in solidarity to Michael. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Vengeance tonight, brother.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> She claps Brian on the shoulder on the way out. <span style=\"color:#0000CD\">&quot;Alright. You heard the whelp.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T20:55:29-08:00","id":1157438,"title":"","content":"Nearly boiling Micheal, stopped in split second. He got stiff and white as paper in just one moment, exactly like he was seeing ghost for the first time in his hunter career. He only muttered terrible words:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">\u201cOh my God\u2026 Family and blood\u2026 Family and blood\u2026 Dear God \u2013 Terrence! We must save my twin brother Terrence!&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}